    "summary": "For a **CALLIDUS ASSASSIN** model. Up to 2 times per battle, but no more than once per battle round, you may do this in your Movement phase:\n\n1. Pick 1 other **INFANTRY** model of yours on the battlefield and outside **Engagement Range** of all enemy units.\n2. Destroy it, ignoring any rules triggered by a model being **destroyed**.\n3. Remove the bearer and set it up again as near as possible to the destroyed model's position, outside Engagement Range of all enemy units.",
